{
	"_doc": [
		"Her interactions (docs/PET_PLAY_PLAN.md), read by play.gd.",
		"kind: you (his gestures set it off), solo / glass (her brain picks them), desk (his desktop's events).",
		"clips: [clip or prefix, weight or feeling] like pet.gd ROLES. face: a mood or look for its length. emote: above her head.",
		"gain: needs and moods it moves (life.gd). cool: seconds before it can happen again.",
		"weight: how much her brain likes it (a number or a feeling), for solo / thing / glass.",
		"glass: walks up to the glass first.",
		"needs: night | day | music | quiet: when it can happen.",
		"mark: [heart | fog | hand | dot, bone, when] something left on the glass where that bone is, that far into the clip.",
		"widget: true (any) or a widget's name: she goes behind it on the glass first (hiding, peeking, reading).",
		"for: seconds of it at most (a part of a long clip). hold: true: set off again while it plays (stroking on), it lasts that much longer, up to its clip.",
		"then: [look, fraction]: the face changes to that one that far in. too_long: [seconds, another]: a hold one kept up that long becomes that one. whole: true: nothing of his cuts in till it's done."
